{"id": "60896", "title": "我们的爱", "author": "万色", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 12, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/60/60896.htm", "intro": "多年暗恋，却得知他心中另有别人 \r\n赔了身心，却最后落得遍体鳞伤 \r\n心如死灰他却又回头坦诚爱意，一段感情究竟该何去何从！？ \r\n本文依旧是渣攻贱受的狗血故事。 \r\n渣攻严瑾，贱受贺绍然。另外还有一高富帅的炮灰攻，和表面白莲花内心却恶毒无比的炮灰受...... \r\n\r\n属性分类：现代／都市生活／强攻强受／黑暗 \r\n\r\n\r\n关键词：严瑾 　王阿瑟 　其他", "base": "files/article/html/60/60896", "chapters": [{"title": "1-15", "file": "8952373.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-24", "file": "8952375.html", "available": false}, {"title": "25-32", "file": "8952378.html", "available": false}, {"title": "33-40", "file": "8952381.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-48", "file": "8952384.html", "available": false}, {"title": "49-55", "file": "8952386.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-63", "file": "8952388.html", "available": false}, {"title": "64-73", "file": "8952389.html", "available": false}, {"title": "74-83", "file": "8952390.html", "available": false}, {"title": "84-93", "file": "8952392.html", "available": false}, {"title": "94-101", "file": "8952395.html", "available": false}, {"title": "102-105完结", "file": "8952397.html", "available": false}]}